  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>本模组仅适用于 1.20.4 - 1.21.1。NeoForge 版本的最新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" rel=\"nofollow\">转移至此</a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hvBicGR.png\" alt=\"YUNG&#x27;s Extras\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><br><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"Depends on YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"Join the YUNG GANG on Discord!\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"Follow me on Twitter!\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"Subscribe to my YouTube!\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon!\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2HNgRET.png\" alt=\"What is this?\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;无数种结构、特性以及原版+内容。本模组收集了一系列对原版 Minecraft 的升级，每一项单独来看都太小，不足以制作成独立的模组，但合在一起却能为你的整合包增添完美的点睛之笔。它是任何整合包的“樱桃”。</p>\n<p>最新版本是<strong>沼泽结构更新</strong>，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>大量</em>废墟</li>\n<li>古代石柱</li>\n<li>少数<em>极其</em>稀有的彩蛋结构 ;)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>初始版本是<strong>沙漠装饰更新</strong>，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全新且改进的沙漠水井（包括罕见的<strong>许愿井</strong>，底部可能藏有宝藏！）</li>\n<li>沙漠方尖碑</li>\n<li>火焰前哨站</li>\n<li>更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本模组将随时间推移持续更新内容，改善游戏的不同部分！</p>\n<p>本模组非常轻量，对性能的影响极小。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0XXV7z4.png\" alt=\"Compatibility\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Extras 旨在与所有世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Dungeons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Terralith 和其他生物群系模组</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"Use code YUNGNICKYOUNG with Bisect Hosting for 25% off!\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
